From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] apphelp, sdbinst: Compatibility databases (6059)

apphelp reads and writes application compatibility databases (.sdb):
SdbOpenDatabase, SdbCreateDatabase and SdbCloseDatabase(Write), the tag
walk (SdbGetFirstChild, SdbGetNextChild, SdbFindFirstTag, SdbFindNextTag,
SdbGetTagFromTagID), the typed reads and writes, list tags, the string
table, SdbGetDatabaseID/Version, SdbTagToString, the GUID helpers and
SdbInitDatabase/SdbReleaseDatabase. sdbinst installs a database into
AppPatch\Custom and the AppCompatFlags keys, and uninstalls it by file,
GUID or name.
---
